    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-Isam31">
        <head xml:id="gom-Isam31-Hd1e98">Caput 31</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-Isam31-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-Isam31-Hd1e102">Versus 2</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-Isam31-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-Isam31-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/Isam31_2@9-10">Percusserunt Jonathan,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-Isam31-Rd1e109"><name xml:id="gom-Isam31-Nd1e110" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name> in lib. Reg. tom. II.</ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-Isam31-Qd1e114"><seg type="qs">Jonathan, Abinadab</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">cum filiis periret.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-Isam31-Dd1e123">
          <head xml:id="gom-Isam31-Hd1e125">Versus 4</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-Isam31-d1e127">
            <quote xml:id="gom-Isam31-Qd1e129" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/Isam31_4@31-32">Arripuit itaque.</quote>
            Gladio quo Amalecitis <pb ed="#P" n="0562D"/> contra praeceptum Dei pepercit, merito seipsum occidit: sic qui potestate pro communi utilitate accepta, aut non utitur aut abutitur, suo se nimirum gladio confodit, et quo ab hoste defendi debuerat, hostem potius juvat.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-Isam31-Dd1e136">
          <head xml:id="gom-Isam31-Hd1e138">Versus 11</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-Isam31-d1e140">
            <quote xml:id="gom-Isam31-Qd1e142" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/Isam31_11@4-4">Habitatores.</quote>
            Quos Saul ab adversariis defenderat, rependunt quod possunt. Nos quoque benefactores nostros gladio peccati peremptos, quoad possumus, a Philisthinorum opprobrio eripiamus.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
